<title>JAPAN: Fujix - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fujix - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  3.75		vs	    3.92</p>
<p> Operating	  180    million	  vs	  248    million</p>
<p> Current	    215    million	  vs	  268    million</p>
<p> Net		  152    million	  vs	  127    million</p>
<p> EPS		   20.67 yen	  vs	   17.18 yen</p>
<p> Shares		7 million	  vs	   7 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Fujix Ltd is a major specialist in sewing threads.</p>
